# =====================================================
# EmailJS credentials (safe to expose — these are PUBLIC keys)
# Sign up at https://www.emailjs.com and grab these values.
#
# 1. Create an Email Service (Gmail) and connect your Gmail account.
# 2. Create an Email Template with these variables:
#    {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{message}}, {{reply_to}}
# 3. Copy the IDs and the Public Key below.
#
# After filling this in, rename this file to `.env` and rebuild the app.
# =====================================================

